  "walletSyncServerSwitchNotice": "Switching restarts the sync in progress. Your balance and history stay. Funds may show as arriving until the new server's scan catches up.",
  "@walletSyncServerSwitchNotice": {
    "description": "The in-flight notice body while CONNECTING or SCANNING (before ANY switch): the cost (the pass in progress restarts on the new server), the reassurance (no rescan — balance, history and queued sends are untouched), and the honest caveat (the card may read pending until the new server's scan catches up — fold of the walk). At an up-to-date status the sheet shows walletSyncServerSwitchNoticeAtTip instead."
