  "walletTransportExplainBootstrapping": "Your app's private path is starting up. Wallet traffic waits for it before connecting.",
  "@walletTransportExplainBootstrapping": {
    "description": "Sync sheet Connection explanation: the private path is starting. The NEUTRAL variant (no name to show); walletTransportExplainBootstrappingNamed names the host's transport when the descriptor does."
