  "walletSendFaultCouldNotPrepareTransient": "Couldn't prepare this payment just now. Try again in a moment.",
  "@walletSendFaultCouldNotPrepareTransient": {
    "description": "Form fault: a prepare failure the wallet's OWN state will clear without the user changing anything — a note whose witness the scan has not completed, an anchor not yet recorded, an input a concurrent proposal holds (WalletErrorKind.proposeTransient, INC-018 (b), phase-2 P2-2, maintainer decision 4). MUST NOT say 'check the details': on the device proof the details were correct and the identical send prepared fine two minutes later. 'Just now' + 'in a moment' — a short wait, not a sync-length one (that is walletSendFaultNotSynced)."
