    "description": "Tracking: the COLD-attach / first-load busy title, shown while the swap's status is being established and no answer has arrived yet — a fresh re-attach after process death (no carried state), or the moment just after execute before the first poll returns. Neutral BY DESIGN: 'Swap started' (walletSwapStatusPendingTitle) over-claims a state we have not confirmed (the swap may already be further along, or not yet started). The '…' is a real U+2026 ellipsis. (#347, cold-attach label)"
