  "walletSwapStatusPendingBodyOutOfZec": "Your wallet is sending the ZEC deposit to the provider. If you're briefly offline it's sent automatically when you're back — but the sending window is short, and if it closes first the swap simply ends and nothing is exchanged. Your ZEC stays yours, and it can take up to an hour to show as spendable again.",
  "@walletSwapStatusPendingBodyOutOfZec": {
