  "walletSwapStatusPendingBodyIntoZecReattached": "This swap is still waiting for its deposit. The deposit instructions aren't available on this device anymore — if you already sent the funds, they'll be detected; if you haven't, let this swap expire and start a new one.",
  "@walletSwapStatusPendingBodyIntoZecReattached": {
